        "U3"
      ],
      "text": "Sequences and outcomes are finite-model deductions, not observed trials or global-optimality proof. B9 discrepancy cause and later downstream request adaptation remain unknown. Future adaptation is only a hypothesis and cannot alter present demand or support an additional mechanism."
    }
  ],
  "summary": [
    {
