        "R3"
      ],
      "text": "Proposed migration keeps source-to-rack transfer and inspection, correction and sealing, while replacing powered supply with hand-carrier supply. Retain all identifiers, arrival-order inspection and B9 correction. Success remains twelve correct sealed releases by minute 13; transfer labor ranks complete successes only."
