      ],
      "text": "Closest rival: trolley B4-B7 at 0-3, trolley B8-B11 at 3-6, hand B12 at 6-7. Migrated sequence: nine hand trips at 0-9. Continuous inspection includes B9 at 8-10. Predicted outputs: both release twelve by 13 without unload waits; the same transfer clerk occupies seven versus nine minutes and inspection occupies thirteen. Original supply wins; migration saves trolley allowances but adds two labor minutes."
    },
