      "text": "Separating probe: evaluate both schedules and legal ablations through ledger identities, correct completed releases, occupied intervals and rack states. Interaction account requires output beyond parent-schedule predictions; arithmetic account predicts the stated timing and labor without an extra mechanism. Keep nine source unloads distinct from twelve releases; packing marks cannot substitute for completed seals."
